      "label": "common_1150_rival_04",
      "hash64": "CFFCCA6151605212",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就把[VAR 0x0101(0001)]放出來吧！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
